sequenceDiagram
  participant Verify as Bundle verifier
  participant Shell as Frozen Qt shell
  participant Page as QWebEngine page
  participant API as Existing Flask API
  participant Adapter as Restricted probe adapter
  participant Life as Shutdown coordinator

  Verify->>Verify: Create private root and 256-bit run ID
  Verify->>Shell: Launch with paired internal environment variables
  Shell->>Shell: Validate frozen mode, root, owner, and run ID
  Shell->>Shell: Arm 180-second probe watchdog
  Shell->>Page: Load loopback page and verify DOM app-ready
  Page-->>Shell: DOM ready
  Shell-->>Verify: Atomically publish matching ready marker
  Verify->>API: GET root, extract token, call open/parse/validate/preview
  API->>Adapter: Choose fixed input and output paths
  Adapter-->>API: Paths confined to private root
  Verify->>API: Save YAML and export GDS with path tokens
  API-->>Verify: SVG, YAML, GDS, or a preserved failure
  alt Finally publishes a valid command before deadline
    Verify->>Shell: Atomically publish matching shutdown command
    Shell->>Life: Cancel probe timer and invoke the single coordinator
  else No valid command by 180 seconds
    Shell->>Life: Invoke the same coordinator with probe timeout
  end
  Life-->>Verify: Publish cleanup marker, then exit
